    <preface>
      <p>Excise Levies Legislation Amendment (Honey) Act 2018</p>
      <p>No. 119, 2018</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law relating to excise levies in respect of honey, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
